products.description:
is an electro-medical device for therapeutic treatments using a laser with a laser power of 8W which supplies the treatment by using handpieces. This device is therapeutic, non-invasive and it is mainly used by hand physiatrists, physiotherapists and pain therapists. The machine may be used in hospital and clinic premises.
Supplied with
User Manual;
n.1 mains power supply cable;
n.1 defocused laser handpiece in optical fiber (integral to the device);
n.1 pedal;
n.1 interlock key;
n.1 smart-card;
n.2 protective laser glasses;
n. 2 fuses;
Technical Spec.
Interlock key:3-pole contacts
Max power:8W ± 20%
LCD back-lit display:320 x 240 pixel TOUCH SCREEN
Pulsed mode:10% - 100%
